{"html":"\n  \u003cdiv class=\"page-inner flex flex-col justify-between\">\n    \u003cheader class=\"mast\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"brand\">\n        \u003cstrong>AlpacaNotes\u003c/strong>\n        \u003cspan class=\"kicker\">PART 01 · 同一公理基础与 Ruliad\u003c/span>\n      \u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"masttime font-mono text-xs\">\n        \u003cspan>PROPOSITION 1.2 · 因果流程 · PAGE 04 / 20\u003c/span>\n      \u003c/div>\n    \u003c/header>\n\n    \u003cdiv class=\"pb-2.5 border-b-2 border-ink dark:border-neutral-700\">\n      \u003ch2 class=\"ed-page-title font-serif text-[34px] font-black text-ink dark:text-white leading-tight\">\n        \u003cspan class=\"text-accent font-mono mr-3\">[1.2]\u003c/span>形式公理的元建模\n      \u003c/h2>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"flex items-baseline gap-3 pl-3.5 border-l-4 border-accent mt-2\">\n        \u003cspan class=\"text-[12px] font-mono font-bold text-accent uppercase tracking-wider shrink-0 bg-accent/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded\">核心论断\u003c/span>\n        \u003cp class=\"ed-thesis-text font-serif text-[21px] text-ink dark:text-neutral-200 font-semibold leading-snug\">\n          任意公理体系皆可降解为符号树模式替换多路图，将证明转为测地线搜索。\n        \u003c/p>\n      \u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n\n    \n    \u003cdiv class=\"ed-main ed-layout-seq ed-seq-4 flex items-center my-auto h-[600px]\">\n      \n        \u003cdiv class=\"ed-seq-card flex-1 card border-t-4 bg-white dark:bg-[#242424] rounded-xl border border-slate-200/90 dark:border-neutral-800 shadow-sm p-6 flex flex-col justify-between h-[590px]\" style=\"border-top-color:#1b4f72;\">\n          \u003cdiv class=\"ed-card-text-col\">\n            \u003cdiv class=\"flex items-center justify-between pb-2.5 mb-3 border-b border-slate-100 dark:border-neutral-800\">\n              \u003cspan class=\"text-[13px] font-mono font-extrabold tracking-widest px-2.5 py-1 rounded\" style=\"background:#1b4f7216; color:#1b4f72;\">STEP 01\u003c/span>\n              \u003cspan class=\"text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400\">STAGE 1/4\u003c/span>\n            \u003c/div>\n            \u003ch3 class=\"ed-card-title font-serif text-[25px] font-bold text-ink dark:text-white mb-3.5 leading-snug\">\n              统一符号树编码\n            \u003c/h3>\n            \u003cul class=\"space-y-3\">\n              \n        \u003cli class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n          \u003cspan class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-2.5 shrink-0\">\u003c/span>\n          \u003cspan class=\"ed-bullet-text text-[21px] leading-[1.56] text-[#1a2233] dark:text-neutral-200 font-sans\">\n            \u003cstrong class=\"font-bold text-ink dark:text-white\">机器码表征\u003c/strong>：数学命题同构为算子头与参数构成的表达式树。\n          \u003c/span>\n        \u003c/li>\n        \u003cli class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n          \u003cspan class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-2.5 shrink-0\">\u003c/span>\n          \u003cspan class=\"ed-bullet-text text-[21px] leading-[1.56] text-[#1a2233] dark:text-neutral-200 font-sans\">\n            \u003cstrong class=\"font-bold text-ink dark:text-white\">原生模式量化\u003c/strong>：模式变量内化全称语义，公理化为双向重写规则。\n          \u003c/span>\n        \u003c/li>\n            \u003c/ul>\n          \u003c/div>\n          \n      \u003cdiv class=\"ed-card-visual mt-auto pt-3 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-neutral-700/80 flex flex-col gap-2\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"ed-svg-box rounded-lg bg-slate-50/75 dark:bg-[#2b2b2b] p-2 border border-slate-100 dark:border-neutral-700/80\">\n          \u003csvg viewBox=\"0 0 280 120\" class=\"w-full h-[115px]\" fill=\"none\">\n          \u003ccircle cx=\"140\" cy=\"24\" r=\"16\" fill=\"#2b6cb0\" fill-opacity=\"0.15\" stroke=\"#2b6cb0\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/>\n          \u003ctext x=\"140\" y=\"28\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#2b6cb0\">Plus\u003c/text>\n          \u003cpath d=\"M128 36 L85 78 M152 36 L195 78\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n          \u003ccircle cx=\"80\" cy=\"86\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#0284c7\" fill-opacity=\"0.12\" stroke=\"#0284c7\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n          \u003ctext x=\"80\" y=\"90\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#0284c7\">a_\u003c/text>\n          \u003ccircle cx=\"200\" cy=\"86\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#0284c7\" fill-opacity=\"0.12\" stroke=\"#0284c7\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n          \u003ctext x=\"200\" y=\"90\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#0284c7\">b_\u003c/text>\n        \u003c/svg>\n        \u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"ed-note-text text-[17px] leading-[1.45] text-slate-600 dark:text-neutral-300 font-sans px-1\">\n          \u003cspan class=\"text-[12px] font-mono font-bold px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-1.5\" style=\"background:#1b4f7216; color:#1b4f72;\">示例\u003c/span>\n          \u003cspan>a + b 编码为 Plus[a, b] 树节点。\u003c/span>\n        \u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n        \u003c/div>\n            \u003cdiv class=\"ed-seq-arrow flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 w-7 text-accent/60\">\n              \u003ci class=\"fa-solid fa-chevron-right text-2xl\">\u003c/i>\n            \u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"ed-seq-card flex-1 card border-t-4 bg-white dark:bg-[#242424] rounded-xl border border-slate-200/90 dark:border-neutral-800 shadow-sm p-6 flex flex-col justify-between h-[590px]\" style=\"border-top-color:#0284c7;\">\n          \u003cdiv class=\"ed-card-text-col\">\n            \u003cdiv class=\"flex items-center justify-between pb-2.5 mb-3 border-b border-slate-100 dark:border-neutral-800\">\n              \u003cspan class=\"text-[13px] font-mono font-extrabold tracking-widest px-2.5 py-1 rounded\" style=\"background:#0284c716; color:#0284c7;\">STEP 02\u003c/span>\n              \u003cspan class=\"text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400\">STAGE 2/4\u003c/span>\n            \u003c/div>\n            \u003ch3 class=\"ed-card-title font-serif text-[25px] font-bold text-ink dark:text-white mb-3.5 leading-snug\">\n              多路图与测地线\n            \u003c/h3>\n            \u003cul class=\"space-y-3\">\n              \n        \u003cli class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n          \u003cspan class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-2.5 shrink-0\">\u003c/span>\n          \u003cspan class=\"ed-bullet-text text-[21px] leading-[1.56] text-[#1a2233] dark:text-neutral-200 font-sans\">\n            \u003cstrong class=\"font-bold text-ink dark:text-white\">状态拓扑展开\u003c/strong>：遍历公理代换规则，生成节点为命题的多路有向图。\n          \u003c/span>\n        \u003c/li>\n        \u003cli class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n          \u003cspan class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-2.5 shrink-0\">\u003c/span>\n          \u003cspan class=\"ed-bullet-text text-[21px] leading-[1.56] text-[#1a2233] dark:text-neutral-200 font-sans\">\n            \u003cstrong class=\"font-bold text-ink dark:text-white\">证明即路径\u003c/strong>：两命题等价充要于连通，证明即搜索最短测地线。\n          \u003c/span>\n        \u003c/li>\n            \u003c/ul>\n          \u003c/div>\n          \n      \u003cdiv class=\"ed-card-visual mt-auto pt-3 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-neutral-700/80 flex flex-col gap-2\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"ed-svg-box rounded-lg bg-slate-50/75 dark:bg-[#2b2b2b] p-2 border border-slate-100 dark:border-neutral-700/80\">\n          \u003csvg viewBox=\"0 0 280 120\" class=\"w-full h-[115px]\" fill=\"none\">\n          \u003cpath d=\"M40 60 L110 25 L200 30 L240 60\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-opacity=\"0.4\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/>\n          \u003cpath d=\"M40 60 L115 88 L240 60\" stroke=\"#0284c7\" stroke-width=\"2.6\"/>\n          \u003ccircle cx=\"40\" cy=\"60\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#2b6cb0\" fill-opacity=\"0.18\" stroke=\"#2b6cb0\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/>\n          \u003ccircle cx=\"115\" cy=\"88\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#0284c7\" fill-opacity=\"0.18\" stroke=\"#0284c7\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/>\n          \u003ccircle cx=\"240\" cy=\"60\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#0d9488\" fill-opacity=\"0.18\" stroke=\"#0d9488\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/>\n          \u003ctext x=\"140\" y=\"112\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#0284c7\">最短连通路径 = 证明\u003c/text>\n        \u003c/svg>\n        \u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"ed-note-text text-[17px] leading-[1.45] text-slate-600 dark:text-neutral-300 font-sans px-1\">\n          \u003cspan class=\"text-[12px] font-mono font-bold px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-1.5\" style=\"background:#0284c716; color:#0284c7;\">示例\u003c/span>\n          \u003cspan>两命题连通即等价，最短线即证明。\u003c/span>\n        \u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n        \u003c/div>\n            \u003cdiv class=\"ed-seq-arrow flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 w-7 text-accent/60\">\n              \u003ci class=\"fa-solid fa-chevron-right text-2xl\">\u003c/i>\n            \u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"ed-seq-card flex-1 card border-t-4 bg-white dark:bg-[#242424] rounded-xl border border-slate-200/90 dark:border-neutral-800 shadow-sm p-6 flex flex-col justify-between h-[590px]\" style=\"border-top-color:#b45309;\">\n          \u003cdiv class=\"ed-card-text-col\">\n            \u003cdiv class=\"flex items-center justify-between pb-2.5 mb-3 border-b border-slate-100 dark:border-neutral-800\">\n              \u003cspan class=\"text-[13px] font-mono font-extrabold tracking-widest px-2.5 py-1 rounded\" style=\"background:#b4530916; color:#b45309;\">STEP 03\u003c/span>\n              \u003cspan class=\"text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400\">STAGE 3/4\u003c/span>\n            \u003c/div>\n            \u003ch3 class=\"ed-card-title font-serif text-[25px] font-bold text-ink dark:text-white mb-3.5 leading-snug\">\n              计算不可约膨胀\n            \u003c/h3>\n            \u003cul class=\"space-y-3\">\n              \n        \u003cli class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n          \u003cspan class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-2.5 shrink-0\">\u003c/span>\n          \u003cspan class=\"ed-bullet-text text-[21px] leading-[1.56] text-[#1a2233] dark:text-neutral-200 font-sans\">\n            \u003cstrong class=\"font-bold text-ink dark:text-white\">中间表达式膨胀\u003c/strong>：受制于计算不可约性，最短路径常经历剧烈膨胀。\n          \u003c/span>\n        \u003c/li>\n        \u003cli class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n          \u003cspan class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-2.5 shrink-0\">\u003c/span>\n          \u003cspan class=\"ed-bullet-text text-[21px] leading-[1.56] text-[#1a2233] dark:text-neutral-200 font-sans\">\n            \u003cstrong class=\"font-bold text-ink dark:text-white\">判定问题否定\u003c/strong>：不存在跳过推导的通用捷径，导出算术不可判定。\n          \u003c/span>\n        \u003c/li>\n            \u003c/ul>\n          \u003c/div>\n          \n      \u003cdiv class=\"ed-card-visual mt-auto pt-3 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-neutral-700/80 flex flex-col gap-2\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"ed-svg-box rounded-lg bg-slate-50/75 dark:bg-[#2b2b2b] p-2 border border-slate-100 dark:border-neutral-700/80\">\n          \u003csvg viewBox=\"0 0 280 120\" class=\"w-full h-[115px]\" fill=\"none\">\n          \u003cpath d=\"M30 85 Q140 5 250 85\" stroke=\"#d97706\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" fill=\"#d97706\" fill-opacity=\"0.1\"/>\n          \u003ccircle cx=\"30\" cy=\"85\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#2b6cb0\"/>\u003ccircle cx=\"250\" cy=\"85\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#0d9488\"/>\n          \u003ctext x=\"140\" y=\"34\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#d97706\">中间式膨胀峰值\u003c/text>\n          \u003ctext x=\"36\" y=\"106\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#64748b\">起点\u003c/text>\n          \u003ctext x=\"228\" y=\"106\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#64748b\">终点\u003c/text>\n        \u003c/svg>\n        \u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"ed-note-text text-[17px] leading-[1.45] text-slate-600 dark:text-neutral-300 font-sans px-1\">\n          \u003cspan class=\"text-[12px] font-mono font-bold px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-1.5\" style=\"background:#b4530916; color:#b45309;\">现象\u003c/span>\n          \u003cspan>中间表达式常先急剧变大，再坍缩。\u003c/span>\n        \u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n        \u003c/div>\n            \u003cdiv class=\"ed-seq-arrow flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 w-7 text-accent/60\">\n              \u003ci class=\"fa-solid fa-chevron-right text-2xl\">\u003c/i>\n            \u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"ed-seq-card flex-1 card border-t-4 bg-white dark:bg-[#242424] rounded-xl border border-slate-200/90 dark:border-neutral-800 shadow-sm p-6 flex flex-col justify-between h-[590px]\" style=\"border-top-color:#0f766e;\">\n          \u003cdiv class=\"ed-card-text-col\">\n            \u003cdiv class=\"flex items-center justify-between pb-2.5 mb-3 border-b border-slate-100 dark:border-neutral-800\">\n              \u003cspan class=\"text-[13px] font-mono font-extrabold tracking-widest px-2.5 py-1 rounded\" style=\"background:#0f766e16; color:#0f766e;\">STEP 04\u003c/span>\n              \u003cspan class=\"text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400\">STAGE 4/4\u003c/span>\n            \u003c/div>\n            \u003ch3 class=\"ed-card-title font-serif text-[25px] font-bold text-ink dark:text-white mb-3.5 leading-snug\">\n              动力系统度规化\n            \u003c/h3>\n            \u003cul class=\"space-y-3\">\n              \n        \u003cli class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n          \u003cspan class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-2.5 shrink-0\">\u003c/span>\n          \u003cspan class=\"ed-bullet-text text-[21px] leading-[1.56] text-[#1a2233] dark:text-neutral-200 font-sans\">\n            \u003cstrong class=\"font-bold text-ink dark:text-white\">赋予因果度规\u003c/strong>：离散逻辑被重塑为具备曲率与长度的演化空间。\n          \u003c/span>\n        \u003c/li>\n        \u003cli class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n          \u003cspan class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-2.5 shrink-0\">\u003c/span>\n          \u003cspan class=\"ed-bullet-text text-[21px] leading-[1.56] text-[#1a2233] dark:text-neutral-200 font-sans\">\n            \u003cstrong class=\"font-bold text-ink dark:text-white\">几何拓扑重构\u003c/strong>：抽象推理转化为可度量的确定性多路动力系统。\n          \u003c/span>\n        \u003c/li>\n            \u003c/ul>\n          \u003c/div>\n          \n      \u003cdiv class=\"ed-card-visual mt-auto pt-3 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-neutral-700/80 flex flex-col gap-2\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"ed-svg-box rounded-lg bg-slate-50/75 dark:bg-[#2b2b2b] p-2 border border-slate-100 dark:border-neutral-700/80\">\n          \u003csvg viewBox=\"0 0 280 120\" class=\"w-full h-[115px]\" fill=\"none\">\n          \u003cpath d=\"M40 30 H240 M40 60 H240 M40 90 H240 M70 15 V105 M140 15 V105 M210 15 V105\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-opacity=\"0.3\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n          \u003cpath d=\"M70 90 L140 60 L210 30\" stroke=\"#0d9488\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/>\n          \u003ccircle cx=\"70\" cy=\"90\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#0d9488\"/>\u003ccircle cx=\"140\" cy=\"60\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#0d9488\"/>\u003ccircle cx=\"210\" cy=\"30\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#0d9488\"/>\n          \u003ctext x=\"160\" y=\"78\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#0d9488\">d = 2 步\u003c/text>\n        \u003c/svg>\n        \u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"ed-note-text text-[17px] leading-[1.45] text-slate-600 dark:text-neutral-300 font-sans px-1\">\n          \u003cspan class=\"text-[12px] font-mono font-bold px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-1.5\" style=\"background:#0f766e16; color:#0f766e;\">类比\u003c/span>\n          \u003cspan>给抽象逻辑推演装上几何“里程表”。\u003c/span>\n        \u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n        \u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n\n    \u003cdiv class=\"ed-bottom-bar pt-2 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-neutral-800\">\n      \n      \u003cdiv class=\"ed-takeaway-wrap flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-2 bg-amber-500/10 dark:bg-amber-950/40 border-l-4 border-amber-600 rounded-r-md max-w-5xl\">\n        \u003ci class=\"fa-solid fa-lightbulb text-amber-600 text-base shrink-0\">\u003c/i>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"ed-takeaway-text text-[20px] leading-tight text-amber-950 dark:text-amber-200 font-sans\">\n          \u003cstrong class=\"font-bold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400\">本节要旨：\u003c/strong>\u003cspan>证明即多路网络中的离散测地线，计算不可约性阻断无限压缩。\u003c/span>\n        \u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"folio font-mono text-xs text-slate-500 shrink-0\">\n        \u003cspan>Stephen Wolfram · The Physicalization of Metamathematics\u003c/span>\n      \u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n  \u003c/div>\n"}